// ============================================================
// Spotify AI Agent — Key Flows (Eraser Sequence Diagrams)
// Paste each block separately into https://app.eraser.io
// ============================================================

// ---------- FLOW 1: Login + Account Creation ----------
title Login & Account Creation

Browser [icon: monitor]
Backend [icon: server]
Spotify [icon: spotify]
Supabase [icon: database]

Browser > Backend: GET /auth/login
Backend > Browser: authorize URL (signed state)
Browser > Spotify: redirect, user approves
Spotify > Backend: GET /auth/callback?code&state
Backend > Backend: verify state JWT
Backend > Spotify: exchange code -> access + refresh tokens
Spotify > Backend: tokens + profile
Backend > Supabase: upsert users row (encrypted tokens)
Backend > Browser: redirect /app?session=<JWT>
Browser > Backend: GET /auth/me (Bearer JWT)
Backend > Browser: user profile


// ---------- FLOW 2: Chat Turn (ReAct + Tools) ----------
title Chat Turn

Browser [icon: monitor]
Backend [icon: server]
DB [icon: database]
LLM [icon: brain]
Spotify [icon: spotify]

Browser > Backend: POST /chat {query} (Bearer JWT)
Backend > DB: load user + chat history
Backend > Spotify: refresh access token if expired
loop [until output or max 8 steps] {
  Backend > LLM: system prompt + messages
  LLM > Backend: JSON action (plan | tool | output)
  alt [type = tool] {
    Backend > Spotify: run tool (search / recommend / queue)
    Spotify > Backend: results -> observation
  }
}
Backend > DB: persist user + assistant messages
Backend > Browser: {response}


// ---------- FLOW 3: Song Recognition (Shazam-like) ----------
title Song Recognition

Browser [icon: monitor]
Backend [icon: server]
AudD [icon: music]

Browser > Browser: record ~8s mic clip (MediaRecorder)
Browser > Backend: POST /recognize (audio, Bearer JWT)
Backend > AudD: forward clip + return=spotify
AudD > Backend: match {title, artist, spotifyUrl}
Backend > Browser: recognized song + Spotify link
